# Dependencies
# (.dockerignore patterns are root-anchored: a bare `node_modules` only matches the
# top-level dir — `**/` is required to also exclude backend/, frontend/, ai-worker/,
# packages/*/ copies. A bare `coverage` let 17 MB of lcov HTML into every build context.)
**/node_modules
.pnp
.pnp.js

# Testing
**/coverage

# Next.js
**/.next
**/out
**/build

# Capacitor native projects — not needed for the Next.js server image
# (these carry multi-GB native build intermediates that otherwise bloat the build context)
frontend/ios
frontend/android

# Production
**/dist

# Misc
.DS_Store
*.pem
*.log
.git
.gitignore
.dockerignore
.env*
!env/*.env
README.md
docker-compose*.yml
scripts
test
*.apk
